    <briefdescription>
<para>Generates an on disk hash table. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This needs an <computeroutput>Info</computeroutput> that handles storing values into the hash table&apos;s payload and computes the hash for a given key. This should provide the following interface:</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">class<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">ExampleInfo<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">public</highlight><highlight class="normal">:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">typedef</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ExampleKey<sp/>key_type;<sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Must<sp/>be<sp/>copy<sp/>constructible</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">typedef</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ExampleKey<sp/>&amp;key_type_ref;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">typedef</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ExampleData<sp/><ref refid="_instr_prof_reader_8cpp_1ad674bc524f54fe7fb728ded6ae31d66d" kindref="member">data_type</ref>;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Must<sp/>be<sp/>copy<sp/>constructible</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">typedef</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ExampleData<sp/>&amp;data_type_ref;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">typedef</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>uint32_t<sp/>hash_value_type;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>The<sp/>type<sp/>the<sp/>hash<sp/>function<sp/>returns.</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">typedef</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>uint32_t<sp/><ref refid="_instr_prof_reader_8cpp_1a098d428243cfee4c355f295ef47cf549" kindref="member">offset_type</ref>;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>The<sp/>type<sp/>for<sp/>offsets<sp/>into<sp/>the<sp/>table.</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="comment"><sp/><sp/>///<sp/>Calculate<sp/>the<sp/>hash<sp/>for<sp/>Key</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">static</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>hash_value_type<sp/><ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_indexed_instr_prof_1a26647986f25d6168afc4204fd79873df" kindref="member">ComputeHash</ref>(key_type_ref<sp/>Key);</highlight><highlight class="comment"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="comment"><sp/><sp/>///<sp/>Return<sp/>the<sp/>lengths,<sp/>in<sp/>bytes,<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>given<sp/>Key/Data<sp/>pair.</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
